                                "sense_id": "0fcd0586-f9da-3d51-a624-f50f6e3c54f3",
                                "text": "Nay, the very Ostentation of the Thorn, is a Weakness, and I might have said a Vice too; for the Vanity Unhallows the very Virtue, especially where it is Accompany'd with Detraction."
